sequenceDiagram
    actor Volunteer
    participant App as SwiftUI iPad App
    participant Server as Rust Server
    participant DB as Database

    Volunteer->>App: Tap Join
    App->>Server: POST /api/v1/activity/{id}/apply
    Server->>DB: Begin transaction
    Server->>DB: Read activity state and capacity
    DB-->>Server: Current values
    Server->>DB: Check existing record
    alt recruitable and available and not duplicate
        Server->>DB: Insert participation record
        Server->>DB: Update volunteer count
        Server->>DB: Commit
        Server-->>App: 200 OK
        App-->>Volunteer: Show applied state
    else any rule fails
        Server->>DB: Roll back
        Server-->>App: 4xx error
        App-->>Volunteer: Show validation message
    end
